{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"devonmochi.ByeType","latestVersion":"1.23.9","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.ae74b4ba.png","priority":1,"sha256":"ae74b4bad2896dd5bdb178b31d30ac5cc8bf96026e656eec7e9339e14890f0a8","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"ByeType 是一个 Markdown 驱动的 AI 语音输入工具，用多模态大模型直接处理原始音频。编辑 Markdown 文件即可自定义专有词汇、转录规则和格式化策略，人名、术语、口水词、数字格式一次转录到位，减少二次修改。支持 macOS、Windows 和 iOS。","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/devonmochi/byetype/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A Markdown-driven AI voice input tool that uses multimodal large models to process raw audio directly.","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"ByeType is a Markdown-driven AI voice input tool. By editing Markdown-formatted prompts, you can customize recognition rules, specialized vocabulary, and text optimization strategies, ensuring voice input aligns as closely as possible with your industry terminology and personal habits.\nAdditionally, ByeType includes an AI-powered OCR feature (also driven by Markdown prompts), perfectly solving the issue of terminal AI-generated code being fragmented by line numbers, split screens, and line breaks, making it impossible to copy directly.\nFree and open-source, using your own API key—ByeType itself is free, does not handle your data, and sends voice inputs and screenshots directly to your chosen AI provider (such as Google or Alibaba Cloud Bailian). Supports macOS and Windows desktop platforms, as well as iPhone/iPad via iOS Shortcuts.","tags":["dictate","dictation","speech-recognition","speech-to-text","transcribe","transcription"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"ByeType 是一个 Markdown 驱动的 AI 语音输入工具，用多模态大模型直接处理原始音频。编辑 Markdown 文件即可自定义专有词汇、转录规则和格式化策略，人名、术语、口水词、数字格式一次转录到位，减少二次修改。支持 macOS、Windows 和 iOS。","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/devonmochi/byetype/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"ByeType 是一个 Markdown 驱动的 AI 语音输入工具。通过编辑 Markdown 格式的提示词，你可以自定义识别规则、专有词汇和文本优化策略，让语音输入最大限度匹配你的行业术语和个人习惯。\n此外，ByeType 还内置了 AI 图像文字提取功能（同样由 Markdown 提示词驱动），完美解决终端中 AI 输出的代码因行号、分屏、换行被切碎而无法直接复制使用的问题。\n免费开源，使用你自己的 API Key — ByeType 本身不收费、不经手数据，语音和截图直接发送到你选择的 AI 服务商（Google、阿里云百炼等）。支持 macOS、Windows 桌面端，以及 iPhone / iPad（通过 iOS 快捷指令）。","name":"ByeType","packageUrl":"https://github.com/devonmochi/byetype","publisher":"ByeType","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/devonmochi","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/devonmochi/byetype/releases/tag/v1.23.9","tags":["听写","语音识别","语音转文字","转写","转录"]}},"longDescription":"ByeType 是一个 Markdown 驱动的 AI 语音输入工具。通过编辑 Markdown 格式的提示词，你可以自定义识别规则、专有词汇和文本优化策略，让语音输入最大限度匹配你的行业术语和个人习惯。\n此外，ByeType 还内置了 AI 图像文字提取功能（同样由 Markdown 提示词驱动），完美解决终端中 AI 输出的代码因行号、分屏、换行被切碎而无法直接复制使用的问题。\n免费开源，使用你自己的 API Key — ByeType 本身不收费、不经手数据，语音和截图直接发送到你选择的 AI 服务商（Google、阿里云百炼等）。支持 macOS、Windows 桌面端，以及 iPhone / iPad（通过 iOS 快捷指令）。","name":"ByeType","packageUrl":"https://github.com/devonmochi/byetype","publisher":"ByeType","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/devonmochi","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/devonmochi/byetype/releases/tag/v1.23.9","tags":["听写","语音识别","语音转文字","转写","转录"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.23.9/app.json","detailSha256":"2c0c314bd9eb2788ed6489ae5b46cbae97785e36665ef1433093bd0f4843b54d","releaseDate":"2026-10-29","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.23.9"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.23.8/app.json","detailSha256":"099818597e03b69f9da55176ffc6cbb09c064122dd9fa5c2128a6e46205d8479","releaseDate":"2026-10-28","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.23.8"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.23.7/app.json","detailSha256":"84162afb0286a79b3c4a85b7ccdfec963b8ecd7c50e286094c9158bd2691b4b8","releaseDate":"2026-10-26","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.23.7"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.23.6/app.json","detailSha256":"d1792b1c4759d43453cb6773f491daebb5ea51a